Two primary endpoints, same decision scores, same test set.
UNION needs alpha split; INTERSECTION-UNION needs no correction but must clear twice.
alpha=0.05, power=0.8, 40000 simulations per step.

=== churn_matched_n100.jsonl ===
    correlation of the AP and ROC-AUC paired differences, across 45 cell-pairs
      median +0.883   IQR +0.769 to +0.921   min +0.485
    median paired sd (AP): 0.0424
    MDE, single endpoint            : 0.0280
    MDE, union (alpha split)        : 0.0313   (+12%)
    MDE, intersection-union         : 0.0298   (+6%)
    cheaper rule here: intersection-union

